  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00007",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 7,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "heading",
    "text_content": "### php.ini",
    "text_hash": "f11e8d719de4f203609759f297335fff6b503323137d5166979cf2e1fbd52a10",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 16,
      "end_line": 16
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini"
    ],
    "heading_level": 3,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00008",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 8,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "Some of following settings need to be adapted to your system, in particular `session.save_path`, `session.cookie_path` (e.g. `/var/www/mysite`), and `session.cookie_domain` (e.g. `ExampleSite.com`).",
    "text_hash": "36f6b729c6356ce1a0a0851c89b8aca403899a7218e1d90d2208a3f2016f0fd2",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 18,
      "end_line": 18
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00009",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 9,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "Run a PHP branch that is listed on the official [Supported Versions](https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php) page and plan upgrades before its security-support end date. Distribution vendors may provide separate extended support, but that does not make the upstream PHP branch supported. Review the [core `php.ini` directives](https://www.php.net/manual/ini.core.php) in the PHP Manual for a complete reference on every value in the `php.ini` configuration file.",
    "text_hash": "9d184f45affa1203d9f1331a4a7ecd1fb1fb3e0f672e8b68eea0471669714cb4",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 20,
      "end_line": 20
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00010",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 10,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "You can find a copy of the following values in a [ready-to-go `php.ini` file here](https://github.com/danehrlich1/very-secure-php-ini).",
    "text_hash": "d535a27c34ad0ae7e27ac4b4628c9b59c4d77eb7a7cb313c1de71e692c11401c",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 22,
      "end_line": 22
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00011",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 11,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "heading",
    "text_content": "#### PHP error handling",
    "text_hash": "44a49b87c4a8a3cdd37ed35534b04b1d06ecd08721923745d7325caca607e31b",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 24,
      "end_line": 24
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP error handling"
    ],
    "heading_level": 4,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00012",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 12,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "code",
    "text_content": "```text\nexpose_php              = Off\nerror_reporting         = E_ALL\ndisplay_errors          = Off\ndisplay_startup_errors  = Off\nlog_errors              = On\nerror_log               = /valid_path/PHP-logs/php_error.log\nignore_repeated_errors  = Off\n```",
    "text_hash": "6af7bb719bd2f6ba7c1d5464294c2e3d9ff17c6190c5e02ae705f9a675746116",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 26,
      "end_line": 34
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP error handling"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": "text",
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00013",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 13,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "Keep in mind that you need to have `display_errors` to `Off` on a production server and it's a good idea to frequently notice the logs.",
    "text_hash": "b58c07cb6fd8f646f51a9cd709e2979f9dcc6fa2e649d32bb93a84699459a321",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 36,
      "end_line": 36
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP error handling"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
