  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00014",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 14,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "heading",
    "text_content": "#### PHP general settings",
    "text_hash": "f9b17cb4444e20fcb109dbe715b4786113e338f548fccd9522b18afee1af4309",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 38,
      "end_line": 38
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP general settings"
    ],
    "heading_level": 4,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00015",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 15,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "code",
    "text_content": "```text\ndoc_root                = /path/DocumentRoot/PHP-scripts/\nopen_basedir            = /path/DocumentRoot/PHP-scripts/\ninclude_path            = /path/PHP-pear/\nextension_dir           = /path/PHP-extensions/\nmime_magic.magicfile    = /path/PHP-magic.mime\nallow_url_fopen         = Off\nallow_url_include       = Off\nvariables_order         = \"GPCS\"\nallow_webdav_methods    = Off\nsession.gc_maxlifetime  = 600\n```",
    "text_hash": "652357b41e5f7e91f976a0d5708bd585c8451374930be18407a7b64a5c12f943",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 40,
      "end_line": 51
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP general settings"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": "text",
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00016",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 16,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "`allow_url_*` prevents [LFI](https://www.acunetix.com/blog/articles/local-file-inclusion-lfi/)s to be easily escalated to [RFI](https://www.acunetix.com/blog/articles/remote-file-inclusion-rfi/)s.",
    "text_hash": "6791f293389f4287c934e6693840db49022a1c3fdf8a8853dc403474d26fa817",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 53,
      "end_line": 53
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP general settings"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00017",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 17,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "heading",
    "text_content": "#### PHP file upload handling",
    "text_hash": "0ccf474ffd82606830aad0f0da77abd3dfcac5edcfe0103adb024e87ff4c05e3",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 55,
      "end_line": 55
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP file upload handling"
    ],
    "heading_level": 4,
    "code_language": null,
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00018",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 18,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "code",
    "text_content": "```text\nfile_uploads            = On\nupload_tmp_dir          = /path/PHP-uploads/\nupload_max_filesize     = 2M\nmax_file_uploads        = 2\n```",
    "text_hash": "22f8d344a98d274dd436203135c5a27943b0e6d521e77b140c6ba5071d5276b8",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 57,
      "end_line": 62
    },
    "heading_path": [
      "PHP Configuration Cheat Sheet",
      "PHP Configuration and Deployment",
      "php.ini",
      "PHP file upload handling"
    ],
    "heading_level": null,
    "code_language": "text",
    "lang": null,
    "table_header_cols": null,
    "table_rows": null,
    "continues_from_previous": false,
    "raw_record": null
  },
  {
    "block_id": "ver_e880e38449f2_b00019",
    "document_id": "doc_owasp_a05_php_configuration_cheat_sheet",
    "version_id": "ver_e880e38449f2",
    "block_idx": 19,
    "file_format": "MARKDOWN",
    "block_type": "paragraph",
    "text_content": "If your application is not using file uploads, and say the only data the user will enter / upload is forms that do not require any document attachments, `file_uploads` should be turned `Off`.",
    "text_hash": "f3a12b79688c2d4d04b27e907d2d945a46a004608601ec4659a4441fb551ee68",
    "parser_name": "markdown-it-py",
    "parser_version": "4.0.0",
    "locator": {
      "start_line": 64,
      "end_line": 64
    },
    "heading_path": [
